  "expectation": "Fails when the primary language subtags of lang and xml:lang differ\n(lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"de\"): which language applies then depends on the user\nagent. Matching primary subtags with different regions (en-GB / en-US, en /\nen-GB) pass, as ACT 5b7ae0 compares primary subtags. Without xml:lang the rule\ndoes not apply. One finding at the html element.",
